url: "https://blazephoenix.xyz"
abstract: >-
  A fully on-chain DeFi router and aggregator for the EVM. Routing runs inside
  the executing transaction: pool discovery, quoting, believability filtering,
  split allocation across up to four legs per hop, multi-hop assembly up to
  three hops, and deterministic Uniswap V4 pool derivation, with no off-chain
  price feed, keeper or sequencer. Every route is priced on the pool's measured
  marginal output rather than self-reported state; the quoted output and the
  enforced floor come from one evaluator (quote equals execution); every swap
  fails closed on the output floor. Venues: Uniswap V2, V3 and V4 (native-ETH
  pools included), Algebra (dynamic fee) and Solidly. The repository also
  publishes its own assurance apparatus: a curated, named mutation guard, a
  shared-quantity register, a calldata-field confirmation matrix, a
  projection-distance measure over every refusal site, a regime-by-oracle
  coverage lattice, a sound executed-bytecode lower bound on the shipped
  binary, and a funded public bug bounty - every number printed beside its
  denominator.
